<title>USA: Cross-Continent Auto completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Cross-Continent Auto completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO, Texas 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cross-Continent Auto Retailers Inc said Wednesday it has completed the previously announced acquisition of Lynn Hickey Dodge of Oklahoma City for about $14 million.</p>
<p>Lynn Hickey Dodge is one of the top five Dodge dealerships in the United States with sales in excess of $120 million, Cross-Continent said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
